# gap: jvm report only a generic "not supported" message; give it a specific diagnostic
basic: `g%` has 2 dimensions -- SIZEOF needs an axis argument, e.g. `SIZEOF(g%, 0)`
c: `g%` has 2 dimensions -- sizeof needs an axis argument, e.g. `sizeof(g%, 0)`
jvm: Print is not supported by the minimal JVM backend yet
